<title>UK: Frankfurter Hypo ups March 2003 bond to 1.5bln Dem.</title>
<headline>Frankfurter Hypo ups March 2003 bond to 1.5bln Dem.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Vereinsbank, Deutsche Bank, Dresdner Bank and UBS, has been increased.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANKFURTER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.75 PCT  MATURITY    05.MAR.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.55    PAY DATE  **21.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*ADDS 500 MLN MARKS</p>
<p>		**FUNGIBLE AT PAY DATE</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
